---
/**
 * `/work` no longer exists as a surface.
 *
 * It listed the paths and the agents. Both now live in the rail, and the home
 * names the three agents worth starting from — so this page was a menu duplicating
 * a menu. The URL is kept because it is linked from elsewhere and typed from habit.
 *
 * Static output, so this is a client-side redirect rather than a 302.
 */
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/home" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="/home" />
  <title>Cadence</title>
</head>
<body>
  <p><a href="/home">Continue to Cadence</a></p>
  <script>window.location.replace('/home');</script>
</body>
</html>
